        {
          "id": "R3",
          "text": "Each object has exactly the four keys sku, name, price, in_stock, with correct values; name is the product name unchanged, with the quoted CSV value \"Braided Cable, 2 m\" as a single field. Indentation, spacing, and key order are free.",
